# Baseline and save-state isolation

Gate every new tactical rule behind `OptionalRulesetConfig` in `web/src/engine/types/ruleset.ts`. When every flag is `false`, the existing Vitest baseline (the 550-test suite) must pass with zero state-hash changes.

Hydrate a legacy save that has no `rulesetConfig` with `DEFAULT_LEGACY_RULESET` (all flags `false`).

Player-facing copy says `"IO"` or `"Industrial Output"`. Never show `"IPC"` in the UI.
